Mr. Theng Sothol said this on the occasion of leading district administration officials in cooperation with the Department of Public Works and Transport of Phnom Penh and Bok Sipai Company to inspect the progress of road construction around Boeung Trabek Reservoir and open Road 492 to Street 105. Located in Sangkat Phsar Doeum Thkov, Khan Chamkarmon, Phnom Penh on the afternoon of March 30, 2022.
Mr. Theng Sothol said that the current progress of the inspection is to find out the possibility of restoring the Boeung Trabek Reservoir with the inspection of the road construction around the Boeung Trabek Reservoir. He said that for the construction of the road around the Boeung Trabek Reservoir, the team has completed more than 80%, while the road around the Boeung Trabek Reservoir is more than 800 meters long.
