A truck carrying wood broke its wheel, seriously injuring 3 people in Rovieng district, Preah Vihear province
(Preah Vihear): At least three people were seriously injured and were immediately sent to Kampong Thom Provincial Hospital after a truck overturned on National Road 62 in Romchek village. Romney commune, Rovieng district, Preah Vihear province at 6:05 am on March 30, 2022.
According to sources from the people living near the scene, said that before the incident, they saw a car Samsung Moss color without license plate driving fast in the direction from Preah Vihear to Kampong Thom until the scene. Due to the above, the car broke the rear wheel, causing the car to overturn.
Meanwhile, a police officer from the Central Administration Police Station said that the car was driven by a man and two other passengers (two men and a woman) without knowing the identity of the three seriously injured.
He said that after the incident, the three victims were sent to the emergency room at Kampong Thom Provincial Hospital. The truck was stored at the Rovieng District Police Inspectorate, and the timber was stored at the Rovieng Forestry Administration for legal action.
