Comment: China has been actively working for a peaceful reconstruction of Afghanistan.
From March 30 to 31, His Excellency Wang Yi, Member of the State Council and Minister of Foreign Affairs of China, will chair the 3rd Foreign Ministers' Meeting of Afghanistan's Neighbors in Tun. Xi, Anhui Province, China, to discuss the following projects of the following countries, jointly aimed at stabilizing the situation in Afghanistan, as well as supporting and assisting the Afghan people in the future.
From providing more than $ 50 million in food, medicine and winter supplies to Afghanistan to the purchase of pine nuts by 36 charter flights, bringing in more than $ 22 million to Afghanistan. China has been helping the people of Afghanistan get out of trouble by practical operations.
China is the only strong country that has not affected Afghanistan, this is a phrase that the Afghan people have always said, and also the reality of the long-standing friendship between China and Afghanistan. As a neighbor, China sees that the Afghan people need to control their own destiny, and no external force can use Afghanistan to their advantage.
The 3rd Foreign Ministers' Meeting of Afghanistan's Neighbors, which is about to open, reaffirms that China is a true friend and hope that Afghanistan will be better and a positive force that supports peace. The world is always stuck. American Chamber of Commerce in Cambodia (AmCham) Supports Demining in Prey Veng
During the signing ceremony, a donation of $ 9,850 from the AmCham Board of Trustees was handed over to the Mines Authority to support demining work in Prey Veng province on a 3.6-hectare mine by the National Center. Manage the Peacekeeping and Mine Action (NPMEC) Peacekeeping Force (NPMEC), which plans to declare Prey Veng a demining province in the near future after receiving high-level approval and recommendations from Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
Senior Minister Ly Thuch said that Cambodia has achieved a lot for the field of mine action in Cambodia with the support of development partners and friendly countries in the past and today, and today is a historic time because never Any private company comes to the Mine Authority and participates in cooperation and support for the mine action sector.
On behalf of the Royal Government of Cambodia, the Senior Minister thanked the American Chamber of Commerce in Cambodia, led by Mr. Anthony Galliano, and members for their generosity, commitment and compassion to join the Royal Government through the Mine Action Authority in supporting mine clearance in Cambodia; Made safer as well as cleared of mines faster for the people of Prey Veng.
On that occasion, the Senior Minister believes and hopes that the US Chamber of Commerce will continue to contribute to demining work until Cambodia achieves its ultimate goal of granting freedom to those who are threatened by landmines and Explosive remnants of war.
Kep Provincial Governor Introduces 6 Additional Points to Kep City Administration and Relevant Institutions for 2022
(Kep): Speaking at the Closing Ceremony of the Meeting to Summarize the Work Results for the Year 2021 and the Work Performance Guidelines for the Year 2022 of the Kep Municipality on the afternoon of March 29, 2022, Mr. Som Piseth, Governor of Kep Province, issued important instructions. 6 points to the Kep City Administration and all relevant institutions to participate in the implementation of high efficiency for the implementation of the work in 2022.
The meeting was held at Kep City Hall with the participation of Mrs. Tith Sokha, Kep City Governor, District Governor and more than 100 stakeholders.
Mr. Som Piseth's 6 additional recommendations include:
* First, cooperate to expedite the settlement by carefully managing the statistical data, the identity of the people and the land occupied on the land in the protected area and forest cover in each district.
* Second: We must expedite the resolution of land disputes as soon as possible to avoid leaving those disputes for a long time, leading to complications in resolution.
* 3: To educate, guide and disseminate to local authorities, people and stakeholders to have a clear understanding of the forest law, the fisheries law and the law on protected areas for all people to cooperate in protecting the forest.
* 4: The municipal administration must develop a planning system and strengthen the social accountability system, which must continue to pay attention to the implementation of the five-year development planning system.
* 5: Continue to strive to solve challenges and provide local public services to make it easier for people.
* 6: Implement measures to combat Kovid-19 now and in the future in Cambodia.
The provincial governor also praised the hard work of the armed forces based on a high sense of responsibility in the performance of duties and responsibilities with the will, loyalty, professional conscience of the leadership of civil servants of the Armed Forces. As well as the participation of development partners, philanthropists, stakeholders, and especially the cooperation and participation of the people.
