Please be informed that on a daily basis, Fresh News has been actively involved in disseminating information on the dangers of drugs in order to contribute to the Royal Government in the fight against drugs in Cambodia. At the same time, Fresh News continues to commit to join the Royal Government in promoting education to contribute to the eradication of drugs in Cambodia. Phnom Penh to host cultural, tourism and sports exhibition at Moradok Techo Stadium from April 6-10
(Phnom Penh): While entertainment programs in the provinces are being prepared for the New Year, cultural, tourism and sports exhibitions will also be held at the Moradok Techo National Stadium for five days from April 6-10, 2022, although there is no Sankranti event like in previous years.
The purpose of this exhibition is to celebrate the traditional Khmer New Year, to promote traditional Khmer culture and tourism products, and to show the face of this large national stadium, which is not only suitable for major sporting events. Not only that, but also a venue for events, cultural exhibitions, tourism, as well as entertainment programs.
Events at the Culture, Tourism and Sports Fair include product exhibitions, traditional dance performances, mixed Khmer folk games, traditional Khmer songs and dances, and Khmer martial arts performances, Tik Tok competitions and contests. Songs, performances, Chai Yam and Guru dances, the Miss Middle Ages pageant, etc., which will take place at different times and hours throughout the 5 days.
This exhibition program is organized by KHBN partner company in collaboration with the National Stadium of Techo Heritage, Phnom Penh Capital Administration, Ministry of Tourism and relevant ministries and institutions, while the official opening ceremony will be presided over by Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism.
"This cultural, tourism and sports exhibition will be an important tourism product to provide entertainment to tourists and people in Phnom Penh and from other provinces," he said.
Mr. Thong Khon also stated that the location of the Moradok Techo National Stadium is one of the most suitable locations for events, including the win-win monument and the safari zoo, which are all important tourist attractions.
Minister Thong Khon and representatives of KHBN event partners also called on the public, tourists as well as the general public to enjoy the cultural, tourism and sports exhibitions.
According to Mr. Thong Khon, in addition to cultural, tourism and sports exhibitions at the Moradok Techo National Stadium in Phnom Penh, in Siem Reap, Kampong Chhnang and other provinces or cities, Sankranti or other entertainment programs are organized according to the ability of Respective authorities.
