(Phnom Penh): Economic Adviser to the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia, Mr. Wu Kuokun, expressed his admiration and admiration for the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia in the fight against Kovid 19 until the best results. .
March 2021 is a difficult time for Cambodian society due to the severe outbreak of the 19-virus virus after the outbreak of communicable disease in the community on 20 February. To combat the epidemic, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, as Commander-in-Chief of the Battle of Shadowless Enemies, has put in place a number of necessary measures, such as closing the epidemic, reducing gatherings, suspending religious gatherings and National New Year, etc.
In addition to the health policy "3 do and 3 prevent" to reduce transmission, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has decided not to hesitate to vaccinate against Kovid 19, despite some criticism and suggestions not to use the vaccine. Chinese aid, though.
Responding to a question from Fresh News reporters during a visit to Cambodia on Tuesday, March 29, 2022, Mr. Wu Kuokun expressed his admiration and admiration for the Royal Government's leadership in the fight. Against Kovid 19 until the current results.
Ms. Youk Sambath, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health and one of the active operators in the fight against the 19 Kovid War, expressed her happiness and pride with the current situation of Kovid 19. For her, looking back to 2021 is a time when operators in the 19-fight war on Kovid have been working hard to prevent the spread of the disease and save lives from Kovid 19.
For Ms. Youk Sambath, the fight against Kovid 19 may not be successful without the wise leadership and the utmost care of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
Accelerating the vaccination of Kovid 19 to the people is seen as an effective way to lead Cambodia to overcome the Kovid 19 pandemic. Cambodia has vaccinated more than 92 percent of its 16 million population. Cambodia is continuing to provide basic vaccination to 3- to 5-year-olds, and is also promoting the third and fourth booster doses for those who have already received the basic doses.
China is a friendly country of Cambodia, which has provided overwhelming support for vaccines for the vaccination process. Cambodia has received up to 40 million doses of vaccines, both grants and orders from China, out of a total of more than 44 million doses that Cambodia has received from friendly countries and the CAVAC mechanism.
Ms. Youk Sambath praised China's cooperation and support in helping Cambodia win the war against the Kovid 19 epidemic. China not only supports the vaccine sector, but also many other facilities and technical equipment.
"We consider China as a strategic provider of vaccines to Cambodia," she said. In the past, we have received a lot of vaccines with the help of China, and in total with this 20 million, we have received more than 28 million doses. We also ordered more than 28 million doses to China, so a total of more than 57 million doses of the vaccine received from China. "No country provides more vaccines to Cambodia."
Economic Adviser to the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia claims that Although Cambodia has eased the epidemic of Kovid 19, the Chinese government and people will continue to assist the Royal Government and the Cambodian people in the fight against Kovid 19. This.
"China and Cambodia are steel friends and we are friends in all seasons, so if the Cambodian side needs anything, we on the Chinese side will do our best to help," Wu said.
Wu Guokuan also claimed that with the worsening situation of the 199 Kovid epidemic, the Chinese government will continue to provide other necessary cooperation to boost trade with Cambodia.
Although the status of the Kovid 19 pandemic has eased, as an operator against Kovid 19, Yuk Sambath continues to call on people to join the fight against Kovid 19 and live a normal life by following the new path. Measures are set by the Royal Government and the Ministry of Health. In particular, be involved in getting vaccinated according to the plan.
