Office of the Spokesman for the Ministry of National Defense: Researchers should not forget the merits of Cambodian officers who once fought for national liberation and maintained peace to this day
(Phnom Penh): The Office of the Spokesman of the Ministry of National Defense on March 30, 2022 reacted to the criticism of the general in Cambodia.
The Defense Ministry spokesman's reaction came after Dr. Sok Touch, president of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, gave a speech last weekend analyzing why Cambodia condemned Russia's invasion of Ukraine, in which he overreacted. Because Cambodia does not yet have submarines, Cambodia does not yet have a bomber, Cambodia does not have military service and Cambodia is rich in generals.
The Office of the Spokesman for the Ministry of Defense said that anyone who made such a comment was not appropriate as a scholar. However, the Office of the Spokesman for the Ministry of National Defense said that commentators should be careful with their words and correct them appropriately, avoiding any comments that go beyond their academic boundaries and go deep into military management.
