The NEC decided to remove the names of 3 candidates from the Candlelight Party candidate list in Phsar Thmei 3 and the Khmer Will Party in Phsar Thmei 3
First, in Case No. 111, the male plaintiff, Pak Pon, filed a petition to delete the list of the first candidates of the Candlelight Party in Sangkat Veal Vong, Kampong Cham City, Kampong Cham Province.
Second, in Case No. 112, the plaintiff, Sar Sara, a male citizen, filed a petition to delete the list of the first candidates of the Candlelight Party in Sangkat Sambour Meas, Kampong Cham City, Kampong Cham Province.
Third: In Case No. 131, Plaintiff Sok Pong Chanvisoth, male, filed a petition to delete the names of three candidates in the list of candidates and to delete the list of candidates of the Candlelight Party in Sangkat Phsar Thmei III, Khan Daun Penh Phnom Penh.
And 4: In Case No. 133, Plaintiff Sok Pongchanvisoth, male, filed a petition to delete the names of 10 candidates in the list of candidates and to delete the list of first candidates of the Khmer Will Party for the Commune Council Election. Sangkat of the 5th mandate in 2022 in Sangkat Phsar Thmei 3, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh.
After hearing the answers of the plaintiffs, the defendants, the answers of the lawyers for the plaintiffs and the lawyers for the defendants, after considering all the facts and after discussing in accordance with the Law on Commune / Sangkat Council Election Regulations and Procedures for the Commune / Sangkat Council Election of the Fifth Mandate 2022: The Trial Chamber of the NEC has decided:
* Keep the list of the first candidates of the Candlelight Party, Sangkat Veal Vong, Kampong Cham City, Kampong Cham Province, valid in Case No. 111, Decision No. 083 NEC. Kampong Cham is valid in Case No. 112, Resolution No. 084 NEC.
* Keep the list of the first candidates of the Candlelight Party in Sangkat Phsar Thmei 3, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh as valid in Case No. 131, Decision No. 084 NEC.
Delete the list of candidates of the Khmer Will Party in Sangkat Phsar Thmei III, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh for the Commune / Sangkat Council Election of the 5th Mandate 2022 in Case No. 133, Decision No. 086 NEC. Representatives of the Khmer Will Party were absent during the hearing.
The decision of the Trial Chamber of the NEC to be heard and announced in public in front of the plaintiffs, defendants and their lawyers is a final decision to close the appeal.
