Secretary of State for the Ministry of Health Youk Sambath and a representative of the Chinese Embassy received the vaccine at Phnom Penh International Airport.
Ms. Youk Sambath said that the 5 million doses of the vaccine was one of 20 million doses that Xi Jinping announced to Cambodia in a telephone meeting with Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen on March 18 ago.
Please note that China is the first person to help vaccinate against measles 19 in Cambodia. The first batch of 600,000 doses of vaccines arrived in Cambodia on February 7, 2021.
