General knowledge: In which country was the newspaper first published?
(Foreign): Nowadays, the media is so important to our world that some countries have declared that "the power of the press" is one of the four great powers, while others, although not Despite this law, the media is considered an influential sector.
Did you know that the history of this newspaper or newspaper originated like this and in what country did it first come into being?
Of course, newspapers have a history of at least five centuries. The first newspaper printing took place in Germany in the late 15th century, printed in the form of short newspapers on large sheets of paper. Surprising content related to war events, economic status, social traditions and interests of humanity is always highlighted.
However, the history of printing can be traced back thousands of years, when the Sumerians in the Middle East learned to convey information by designing sculptures on wet clay. Nowadays, images of information transmission are often made through books, magazines, radio, television, e-mail and electronic newspapers, which we simply call online newspapers. Summary of important news events for March 28, 2022
