(Preah Sihanouk): Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, on the afternoon of March 28, 2022, led a delegation of the Ministry to inspect the progress of the construction of National Road No. 146B to monitor the construction techniques of the company. Construction is carried out in accordance with technical standards and construction contracts, ensuring that this road is of good quality and can be used for a long time.
