Natural disasters! Mixed rain and strong wind affected 16 families in Kampong Svay district, Kampong Thom province
(Kampong Thom): A natural disaster of rain mixed with strong winds caused 16 families to open their roofs, walls and damage some property in O'Romdeng village, Trapeang Russey commune, Kampong Svay district, Kampong Thom province on March 27, 2022 at 8 o'clock. : 30 minutes last night.
According to the report of Mr. Heng Nith, O'Romdeng village chief, he told Fresh News in Kampong Thom province that according to the survey, 15 houses were affected, including the opening of the roof, the collapse of the pillars, the wall and a large amount of property damage. One house was completely damaged and many property was damaged, but it did not affect the lives of any people.
Local authorities have advised local people to pay more attention to natural disasters for the safety of all of us.
It should also be noted that one house that was completely damaged, named Mr. Ros Pheak, male, 27 years old, wife named Mon Theara, 25 years old, also affected some property.
