Prior to the re-declaration, there was an analysis of why Cambodia is a co-founding member of the UN General Assembly emergency resolution on the situation in Ukraine, and among 141 countries. Voted to condemn and demand that Russia withdraw its troops from Ukraine.
The analyst gave four reasons for Cambodia's election against the Russian aggression, including that Cambodia does not yet have submarines, that Cambodia does not yet have bombers, that Cambodia has no military service, and that Cambodia has many generals. Big belly and so on.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen considers that the analysis confuses the position of the Royal Government of Cambodia, claiming that the voice representing Cambodia's foreign policy position is only the King Samdech Techo himself and the Ministry of Foreign Affairs. The other voice is just a scholar or researcher.
"Those who have the right to speak formally for foreign policy on behalf of Cambodia, apart from the King, are the Prime Minister and have an official Ministry of Foreign Affairs. No one else can comment on their position," he said. No, ”he said.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered that the above comment would mean that Cambodia would change its position against Russia and support it. Samdech asked all commentators to be careful when making such comments.
"Our official position is that we strongly oppose the use of force or the threat of using force against another country in international relations, we must respect the independence and sovereignty of countries," he said. "Respect for the independence and sovereignty of Ukraine is equal to respect for the independence and sovereignty of Cambodia."
Samdech stated that although Cambodia is a military power in the world, Cambodia does not use force to invade other countries.
