The senior minister also called on the people who own expired vehicles to hurry to check the technical specifications regularly and in a timely manner for the safety of both drivers and passengers on the road. He also requested people who have expired driver's license not to change or renew their driver's license, please change or extend their driver's license legally to avoid fines when driving on the road.
