Minister Vong Soth: Peace under Samdech Techo's win-win policy for Cambodia to develop from scratch to what it is today
(Tbong Khmum): Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation and Chairman of the National Assistance Team for Ponhea Krek District, Tbong Khmum Province and Cheach Commune, Kamchay Mear District, Prey Veng Province, stated that due to the peace factor under Samdech Techo Hun Sen's win-win policy As the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Cambodia has made great strides from empty hands to what it is today.
Mr. Vong Soth made this statement during the inauguration ceremony of Krek Commune Hall, Concrete Road and Krek Commune Administration Gate on March 28, 2022, with the participation of Tbong Khmum Provincial Governor. Nationality, Ponhea Krek district, district governors, Krek commune authorities, the armed forces and many people.
On that occasion, Minister Vong Soth said, "Cambodia has gone through the Pol Pot era, causing the country to suffer for 3 years, 8 months and 20 days. Today, it has destroyed a lot of infrastructure and cut off many people." "Therefore, we must unite to avoid war, that is, maintain the current peace and continue to work hard to restore people's lives as well as restore the national economy for the better."
Minister Vong Soth stressed that after January 7, under the leadership of the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen as the Prime Minister, there will be full political stability, there will be continuous construction, development, new achievements and progress. The livelihood of the people at the grassroots level during Cambodia during the Kovid 19 crisis, without allowing Cambodia to go back to the past.
At the same time, he also urged district councils, communes, deputy district governors and all local officials in Ponhea Krek district to fulfill their role in providing public services to local people as required by adhering to transparency. Corrupt and partisan.
According to Mr. Ly Sophealin, Governor of Ponhea Krek District, the newly constructed Krek Commune Hall building was officially inaugurated on that occasion. The foundation stone will be built on March 10, 2020 and the school will be completed on June 30, 2021.
In addition, Minister Vong Soth donated 30,000 Riels to members who attended the inauguration of Krek commune hall.
