* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the victory over Kovid 19 showed the efforts of the medical team with the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this time in 2021 was a difficult time for Cambodia due to the 19 cases of Kovid in the community event on February 20, but this year the situation is better.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the success of Kovid 19 is an effort with the responsibility of the Royal Government and the authorities at all levels, with the participation of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announced that this year, Cambodian people will participate in the National New Year. But saddened by the rise in fuel prices due to the crisis in the Russia-Ukraine war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that hotels in Sihanoukville were fully booked for accommodation during the New Year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although the situation of Kovid 19 has improved, Samdech does not encourage people to neglect Kovid 19 while Kovid 19 hospital is still under construction.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Korean government and people for their continued assistance for development in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on doctors to pay attention to the well-being of the people.
* Samdech Techo said that having a good hospital and good facilities is a good thing, but what is better is the care and ethics of doctors to patients.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that traffic accidents are still a concern and regret that requires attention.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to feel calm and not worry about the effects of the vaccine. Samdech Techo encourages to continue to implement the vaccine according to the plan of the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reiterates that the decision to vote against Russia is not because Cambodia does not yet have submarines, not yet bombers, no military service, Cambodia is rich in military belly.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that no matter Russia or any country that invades other countries, Cambodia is absolutely opposed. Such Cambodian opposition is based on international law.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's foreign policy is based on the principles of the United Nations Charter, not to use force or to warn the use of force in international relations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's official position is to oppose the use of force or warn the use of force against other countries must respect the independence and sovereignty of other countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although Cambodia has become a military power in the world, Cambodia does not support the policy of invading other countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia does not need a small plane, but Cambodia set up a sky net by shooting down all the planes that violate Cambodian airspace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the official position of Cambodia is only the King, the Royal Government and the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, other than that.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he did not believe that Russia could attack Kiev and overthrow the Ukrainian administration.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the last option between Russia and Ukraine is to have a negotiation to end the war, it is not possible to put an end to the war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen hopes that the Russian friends will understand Cambodia. Cambodia has been invaded, so Cambodia does not support the invasion.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is not possible to neglect a hot foreign policy that requires Samdech to control and control this situation.
