(China): The Cambodian Students Association of the People's Republic of China has elected the president of the Association of the 5th Mandate, full of ability and hope, Cambodian students who are waiting to return to study in China in 2022.
On March 26, 2022, the Board of Directors of the Cambodian Students Association of the People's Republic of China, chaired by Mr. Ou Vuthy, elected Ms. Hor Reaksmey as President of the Cambodian Students Association of the People's Republic of China for the fifth term. 2022-2023.
According to the president of the association, so far no Cambodian students have returned to study in China directly, but a large number of students have been to universities in China where they The study allowed them to return through the Chinese embassy list and the university's notice.
Recently, the management board of the Chinese Government Scholarship Board (CSC) made a public announcement that all foreign students will return to study in China in early September 2022. New semester, new school year as well.
These are the reasons why almost all students can not afford to return to study in the second semester in March 2022.
