Arrested the first police chief after shooting his stepmother to death in a pool of blood in Prey Veng province, due to a verbal dispute
(Prey Veng): Police Chief of Phnov I Administration, Sithor Kandal District, Prey Veng Province, was arrested and sent to the Provincial Court and detained on March 26, 2022 in the case of shooting his stepmother. Died in a pool of blood.
Prey Veng provincial police informed Fresh News that a shooting occurred that left a woman dead in a pool of blood at 20:30 on March 24, 2022, on the road in front of Wat Phat Sandong in the village. Phat Sandong, Phnov 1 Commune, Sithor Kandal District, Prey Veng Province.
According to the police, the suspect is Mao Sovanhong, a 53-year-old man, the chief of the Phnov 1 administrative police station, living in Phat Sandong village, Phnov 1 commune, Sithor Kandal district, Prey Veng province. The victim, Sok Muy, a 51-year-old female resident of Phnov village, Phnov 1 commune, Sithor Kandal district, was the suspect's stepmother.
Police said that in this incident, the suspect took a handgun brand K54 from the bag and shot at the victim 4 bullets, but 2 bullets hit 1 head and 1 bullet, causing a sudden fall. And the scene.
The cause of the shooting was a verbal altercation on the street after the birthday party of the villagers' children together.
It should be noted that in this shooting incident, under the direct command of Major General Prum Santhor, Prey Veng Provincial Police Commissioner and led by Brigadier General Pov Chivi, Deputy Police Commissioner, received a criminal plan and led the force all night, leading to the arrest of the Post Chief. The first administrative police immediately went to build a case for legal proceedings.
According to the Sithor Kandal district police, even if you have the position of post chief, as long as you break the law, you will be punished like ordinary people, so we must all respect the law. Kampong Chhnang Joint Forces Crack Down on Fishing Offenses for 3 Days, Detain a Vietnamese Man and Seize Many Illegal Fishing Equipment
