Khmer Civilization Expert: Why the war in Ukraine, Russian troops advanced 20 km from the capital Kiev?
Why the war in Ukraine, Russian troops advanced 20 km from the capital Kiev?
"The political, diplomatic and military attitude that the Russian delegation went to wait on the territory of the Belarussians without warning and the timing of the bombing is an indication of the two options," he said.
First, to choose the death or arrest to be tried for the genocide accused by Russia. Second: To choose according to the wishes of Russia, which has already been determined.
At this point, Mr. Rath Sandab raised the question of why the Russian army was walking 20 km from the capital Kiev? Because maybe Russia wants to let the world see:
In addition, the Russian siege of Kiev is also a strategic economic and military game: Russia has taken Ukraine hostage so that the United States can pay to support the Ukrainian air government. Like it or not, if the United States does not pay attention to Ukraine, it will frighten the European Union by seeing the actions of the United States. Destroy empty countries.
