General Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth officially inaugurated the building and achievements at the party office in Kandal province worth more than 8 million dollars
(Kandal): Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Member of the Standing Committee of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Kandal Provincial Party Working Group and High Representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party and Prime Minister of Cambodia On the morning of March 26, 2022, the inauguration of buildings and achievements at the Kandal Provincial Party Office worth more than $ 8 million was inaugurated.
