(Kandal): National Road No. 21 connects Takhmao City, Kandal Province to the Cambodia-Vietnam border (Chrey Thom - Long Binh), which was officially inaugurated on March 23, 2022. Strong from the people to enjoy this road.
National Road No. 21, nearly 64 km long, has been upgraded to AC concrete road and expanded to four lanes, 55 km long and nearly 9 km long, with two lanes, but widened to 11 meters. This road takes time to build, improve the quality and extend for 46 months from April 2015 to July 2019.
Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the inauguration ceremony said that National Road No. 21 is a national road that is closer than other national roads. Samdech Techo also said that this national road serves an important purpose for the transportation of goods of the people in Kandal province and the exchange of goods with Vietnam. In addition, the road also facilitates the connection of electricity from Vietnam.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, said that these roads have been playing an important role in facilitating all types of transportation, especially goods and agricultural products for trade between Cambodia and Vietnam. Promoted and transformed border areas into development and growth zones.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol said, "This road is one of the many achievements across the country that have been providing overwhelming benefits to people across the country born of wise leadership. "The patriotism and patriotism of the people and the wise intellect of Samdech Techo Prime Minister, the founding father and a symbol of peace."
Residents of Koh Thom district, Kandal province, were very happy with the achievement of National Road 21, helping to make it easier for them to transport agricultural products and goods to the market. They said that the achievements of this road have contributed to improving lives.
The people who have been enjoying this road have thanked Samdech Techo Hun Sen for building this road to help improve their lives.
General knowledge: Water with high pH or alkalinity provides tremendous benefits
Water with a high pH or alkalinity has the following benefits:
1: It is a kind of water that is beneficial for daily exercise and requires a large amount of water in the body. Scientifically speaking, the water molecules in such water are smaller, which makes it easier for human cells to absorb and nourish the body, and helps our body to rehydrate more quickly.
2: The benefits of water with a high pH also include increased immunity. The human immune system can help neutralize acids in the body caused by poor diet, alcohol, stress and environmental toxins.
3. Water with a high pH is said to contain many minerals such as magnesium and calcium, both of which are important for maintaining healthy bones.
4. Water with a high pH also contains high levels of antioxidants that inhibit the growth of bad cells, which destroy free radicals in the body, that is, reduce aging.
5. Another very important benefit of water with a high pH is that it neutralizes the acid in the human body by reducing the acid in the stomach and intestines significantly.
