Key Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the Inauguration of National Road 51
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Friday, March 25, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, together with the Economic and Trade Adviser of the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia, inaugurated National Road No. 51, a one-lane road. Important for the transportation of goods and travel of people by connecting between National Road 4 and National Road 5.
On the occasion of the inauguration, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered the following keynote speech for nearly an hour, the main content of Samdech Techo:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that National Road No. 51 is the Phnom Penh Ring Road, facilitating travel without having to pass through Phnom Penh.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that National Road 51 contributes greatly to the socio-economic situation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction of National Road No. 51 was a clear idea of King Duong to connect the trip to the sea.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that National Road No. 51 is still a strategic route of the Royal Government of Cambodia today to connect to the sea.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen, on behalf of the Chinese Ambassador, would like to thank the Government and the people for funding the construction of National Road 51.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has changed its policy in road construction from long construction to high quality construction.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's achievements stem from efforts to end the flames of war and find peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's main priority is peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that before the war, everyone was rich in talking about this or that need. But when there is a war, the main priority is for peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen cited the example of the war between Russia and Ukraine, which now the people and president of Ukraine have given high priority to peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the vision of maintaining peace has always been adhered to by Samdech. Samdech Techo added that no matter what the conditions are, we must work together to maintain peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the achievement of National Road 51 comes from good cooperation between Cambodia and China.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that cooperation between Cambodia and China is bearing many fruits in terms of development, trade and investment.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Kovid 19 could not hinder Cambodia's development process. Chinese projects have not been suspended.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns the governors of Kampong Chhnang and Kampong Speu provinces to be careful not to reach the provincial border, leading to drug densities.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Prime Minister of Japan also believed in karma. Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed during a dinner with the Prime Minister of Japan that he has set his sights on becoming the Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he intended to be only a teacher and a pilot, but the letter determined that Samdech should be the Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that Samdech was the person who held the position of Minister of Foreign Affairs and was the Prime Minister at the youngest age.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that children have knowledge, lack experience, old people lack knowledge, but rich in experience.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2023, Samdech will continue to run as the Prime Minister from the Cambodian People's Party.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that on the occasion of the New Year, Samdech will relax in Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen issued an order to the authorities and the authorities to maintain security to make people happy on the occasion of the New Year.
