Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth Closes the Meeting to Review the Work Results for 2020-2021 and Raise Work Guidelines for 2022 of the Ministry of Public Function
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Economy and Finance, High Representative of Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia, presides over here this morning the closing ceremony of the 2020 Meeting. -2021 and set the work direction for 2022 of the Ministry of Public Function.
Closing remarks, Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth praised and appreciated the achievements of the Ministry of Public Works in the past. At the same time, the Deputy Prime Minister made recommendations to ensure the efficiency of the management of public functions, including the following key points:
First, expedite the completion of the draft of the Public Administration Reform Program 2022-2025 as soon as possible to submit to the Head of the Royal Government for approval, and promote the implementation of the National Public Administration Reform Program in stages with high efficiency.
Second: Prepare to implement the evaluation of model public service units in the education sector for secondary and primary schools and the health sector for health centers.
Third, to improve the efficiency of the administration of the salary administration and the management of the civil service, as well as to continue to support the management and development of human resources in the sub-national administration.
Fourth, continue to develop information technology systems for the management of civil servants to effectively support the management of the Royal Government's public functions, both for national ministries and institutions and for sub-national administrations.
Fifth, to promote and strengthen the inspection work in the field of public functions in ministries, institutions at the national level and sub-national administration effectively
Seventh: Participate in reviewing, evaluating and improving the quality of public services at the national and sub-national levels by paying more attention to the analysis of the functions, structure and staffing of public institutions, as well as promoting the organization and Gradual implementation of performance-based management systems
Eighth, continue to improve the management and administration of work within the framework of the Ministry of Public Works with innovation and in conjunction with the latest digital technology to achieve better efficiency and effectiveness. The Ministry of National Defense vaccinated 19 Kovid 19 soldiers, military families and people in the first dose of 2,759,844 people, the second dose of 2,732,380 people, the third dose of 1,960,329 people and the second dose. 4th, 229,385 people
