1: 84.74 km of National Road No. 5 North (Battambang-Serey Sophorn) which is being implemented under two construction packages and will cost about 143.04 million USD with 3 construction periods. Years.
2. The 135.25-kilometer section of National Road No. 5 South (Prek Kdam-Thla Mam) will be implemented under three construction packages at a cost of approximately $ 246.35 million and will take four years to operate. Build.
