According to the rules and procedures for the Commune / Sangkat Council Election of the 5th Mandate 2022, after the first list of candidates becomes the official list of candidates, the Commune / Sangkat Election Commission (CEC) must hold a lottery to determine The list of candidates on the public ballot by monks or retired dignitaries or elders who are neutral and acceptable to all political parties. This is according to the additional confirmation of the NEC.
