Farmers in Chhnuk Trou commune, Baribo district, Kampong Chhnang province are happy as the prices of pumpkins and cucumbers are higher than in previous years
(Kampong Chhnang): The prices of pumpkins and cucumbers in Meat Kampong Market, Chhnuk Trou Commune, Baribo District, Kampong Chhnang Province in 2022 will be higher than in previous years, making farmers happy to harvest. They traded and encouraged them to continue growing.
According to 55-year-old Prak Buntha, a farmer living in Trapeang Chan village, Trapeang Chan commune, Baribo district, he told Fresh News in Kampong Chhnang province, "Over the years, that could make him, as well as other farmers in Boribo district, happy to harvest."
Farmer Prak Buntha stated that although the above-mentioned crops were sold in the market at a high price, the farmers did not get much profit. Because the price of fertilizer from last year is 100,000 riel per bag, but this year it is up to 200,000 riel per bag. Therefore, compared to the cost of harvesting and selling, it is a reasonable profit that farmers can accept.
