Samdech Techo Hun Sen Instructs National Television and Other TV Networks to Re-broadcast Samdech's Remarks on Order to Eliminate Fishing Lots (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on March 23, 2022 This instructed the national television to re-broadcast Samdech's comment on the order to eliminate fishing lots.
This instruction was made on the occasion that Samdech Techo Hun Sen presided over the closing ceremony of the meeting to review the work of the old year 2021 and the work direction of the new year 2022 of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries on the afternoon of March 23. 2022.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated, "Because there are so many fishing crimes, there are people who think that Samdech should create a fishing lot for the private sector to help manage. "Five hours to talk about the truth, cancel the 100-year-old fishing lot in 2012."
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that because of the crime of fishing from a small number of people that we cracked down on, they did not have the idea that Samdech should create fishing lots for private control, private control and that our farmers suffer. And until death.
Samdech Techo also said that some scholars do not fully understand why Samdech had to cancel the fishing lot, which was established for 100 years in the Royal Decree of King Sisowath in 1912 to cancel in 2012.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that it was not just the reason for cracking down on illegal fishing, but also the opportunity to re-open fishing lots.
In addition, Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked the National Television to accept the problem and cooperate with other TV stations once and for all, and to choose a good time to re-explain Samdech's statement on the order to eliminate fishing lots.
In addition, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also prepared a number of helicopters to crack down on fishing offenders and order the handcuffing of fishing offenders without a policy, and said that the perpetrators of fishing on the lake. The Tonle Sap is not poor.
It should be reminded that more than 10 years ago, Samdech Techo Hun Sen announced the dissolution of commercial fishing lots in the Tonle Sap Lake. Because this business leads to a violation of the rights and freedoms of the people and prevents them from catching fish for family livelihood.
