Russey Keo District Governor Assigns Rehabilitation of O'Bak Touk Canal to Relieve Floods Due to Rainfall in Tuol Sangke I Sangkat
(Phnom Penh): O Bak Touk canal, which could not flow quickly to release water during heavy rains, causing roads and houses to be flooded due to congestion from garbage, is now involved in restoring and beautifying And to use and serve the common good of the people.
