Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group visited Kampong Thom province and instructed the provincial administration to implement 8 action plans to continue the work direction in the future.
(Kampong Thom): As there are still many problems and work to be done for the people, the Royal Government Working Group in Kampong Thom Province and the Kampong Thom Provincial Administration have agreed to put forward an 8-point action plan to continue to jointly implement the work direction this year. 2022 and beyond.
After listening to the report of the outcome of the meeting read by the provincial governor, President Thong Khon, on behalf of the Royal Government of Cambodia, provided several key guidelines, including:
* First, strengthening peace, political stability and security of public order: Local authorities and competent forces at all levels in Kampong Thom province must increase the prevention of all activities of extremist opposition groups. Increase security, public order and social safety, continue to prevent traffic accidents and drug problems.
* Second, the implementation of decentralization and deconcentration reforms: The provincial administration must continue to strengthen the management, management and implementation of functions already transferred from the national level with a high level of ownership and responsibility.
* Third: Sustainable Urban Development, Land Dispute Resolution and Natural Protection: In order to ensure the beautiful, orderly and sustainable development of Kampong Thom Province, Kampong Thom Provincial Administration must continue to strengthen the management of construction of all kinds of problems. Garbage and solid waste, land disputes and natural protection in accordance with technical standards and strictly enforced.
* Fifth: Planning and strengthening of social accountability: Kampong Thom Provincial Administration must continue to pay attention to the implementation of the five-year development planning system that has been prepared and implemented for each type of administration. Open, transparent, consultative, participatory, and consistent with the nature of each administration.
* Sixth: Provision of public services and solving local challenges: The provincial administration must strive to coordinate and strengthen the provision of services through the OWSO at the provincial hall to make it easier for people to receive services in one place. As well as monitoring and supporting the operation of the OWSO and Citizens' Offices in the municipal-district administration to ensure that the provision of these administrative services is transparent and accountable.
* 7th: Combating Kovid-19: All levels of administration in Kampong Thom province, all specialized departments and forces must pay attention to implement the acceleration of Kovid-19 vaccination to encourage people and Vaccination of children from 3 to 5 years of age. Educate and disseminate on a regular basis the implementation of three preventive measures and three contraindications.
* Eighth: Strengthening the work regime: In order to achieve the above important tasks, all levels of administrative leaders must strengthen the working system, working relations, solidarity and internal unity, including the chairpersons of councils and provincial governors. Must increase the strengthening and management of civil servants.
