The main purpose of this visit is to (1) monitor the results of Prime Minister Hun Sen's visit to Myanmar on January 7-8, 2022, (2) to facilitate the implementation of the consensus. Five points achieved at the ASEAN Leaders' Meeting on April 24, 2021 and (3) providing humanitarian assistance to people in need in Myanmar.
