(Phnom Penh): According to the report from the Commune / Sangkat Election Commission (CEC) across the country, which the National Election Committee (NEC) received as of March 21, 2022. Draw to determine the order of the list of candidates on the ballot for the 5th Commune / Sangkat Council Election 2022, achieving 1,355 communes / sangkats out of a total of 1,652 communes / sangkats.
The NEC confirmed that out of the 25 capitals and provinces, Stung Treng and Kep provinces have completed the draw to determine the order of the list of candidates on the ballots of each commune.
According to the rules and procedures for the Commune / Sangkat Council Election of the 5th Mandate in 2022, after the first list of candidates becomes the official list of candidates, the NEC must draw lots to determine the order of the list of candidates on the public ballot. Retired monks or dignitaries or elders who are neutral and acceptable to all political parties.
Please be informed that the draw to determine the order of the list of candidates on the ballot is to enable the NEC to print the ballots for each commune based on the official list of candidates in that commune and the results of the draw. .
