During the inauguration ceremony, Samdech Techo Hun Sen gave a speech for more than 40 minutes, the following are the main contents of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in addition to the concerns about the difficult situation of National Road 21, Samdech also worried about the landslide along this. But now this concern has been resolved.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that National Road No. 21 is scheduled to be inaugurated in 2021, but due to the outbreak of Kovid 19, it has been delayed until now.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that National Road No. 21 was the shortest road and served mainly for communication and trade between Cambodia and Vietnam.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the achievement of National Road 21 is a source of pride for the Cambodian nation compared to the past, when the road was narrow.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that on National Road No. 21, Cambodia uses a contribution of nearly $ 20 million.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanks the government and people of Korea for providing loans for the construction of National Road 21.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the achievements that Cambodia has achieved are the result of cooperation between Cambodia and South Korea.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that South Korea has already decided to provide funding for the construction of a bridge connecting Phnom Penh to the Noble King, with a choice of locations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed the expectation that the current President of the Republic of Korea will continue to support the construction of the Cambodia-Korea Friendship Bridge connecting Phnom Penh to the Noble King.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that these achievements are the result of the relationship and cooperation between Cambodia and South Korea, which Samdech worked hard to build in 1997.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the bridge connecting Phnom Penh to Arey Ksat area was decided to take the construction site from around the night market to Chroy Changva and from Chroy Changva to Arey Ksat.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the construction company of the Ministry of Public Works and the people for their good cooperation in making the road construction complete.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls for joint respect for traffic laws while driving. Do not get a good road and keep crying because of traffic accidents.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the first four tasks that he had to check every morning were the 19 Kovid report, the traffic accident report, the electricity consumption report and the weather report.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in April he attended a water meeting in Japan and in May attended the World Economic Forum in Switzerland.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen orders adherence to the stand against invading Ukraine in international elections.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has made it clear that Cambodia will continue to vote internationally against Russia's invasion of Ukraine. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there were those who asked Cambodia to abstain on the Russia-Ukraine issue.
* Samdech Techo stated that Cambodia continues to vote like in the UN in the past, voting against the invasion of Ukraine. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia does not support the invasion.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the election in support of the Russian war against Ukraine is creating bad habits for the world for strong countries to invade weak countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Russia-Ukraine war caused a crisis worse than the 19-Kovid epidemic.
