The meeting took place at the mouth of the border (Thai territory) in Khut Hin village, Khlong Nam Sai commune, Aranya district, Sa Kaeo province, in front of Banteay II village, O'Sampor commune, Malai district, Banteay Meanchey province.
According to the results of the meeting, the bilateral meeting between the Cambodian and Thai armies today was held to strengthen the bonds of solidarity, cooperation and mutual relations, and the two sides pledged to jointly prevent border crimes and economic crimes. Drug trafficking, transnational crime and illegal migrant workers.
