Interior Ministry Spokesman: Thirty-six people arrested for criminal and drug offenses on March 21
(Phnom Penh): At least 36 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on March 21, 2022 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News this morning, March 22.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 36 suspects, 17 were arrested in eight criminal cases and 19 were arrested in seven drug offenses.
