Diamond exploration first began in Botswana in the 1950s, and it officially became operational in 1971. Some of the world's largest diamond mines were discovered in Botswana during the mid-1980s. Diamonds found in Botswana are generally larger and of better quality than diamonds found in Russia. The largest diamonds found in recent years have all come from Botswana.
4: Australia
Diamond exploration in Canada began in 1998. Ekati Mine is the first diamond mine to operate in Canada. It paved the way for the subsequent development of diamond mines, pushing Canada to become the fifth largest diamond producer today.
Three former CNRP leaders in Battambang province change political stance and express frustration with their former party
(Battambang): The former leader of the Cambodian National Rescue Party (CNRP) in Battambang province has decided to change its political support by voluntarily joining the CPP. With the change in political support, the three former CNRP leaders also expressed frustration at the loss of faith and efforts to help their former party.
In a letter requesting political activism with the CPP, the three former CNRP leaders expressed their disappointment at believing in and trying to serve the former CNRP.
In a letter requesting political participation, the former CNRP leader in Battambang province stated, "We are very sorry to have lost faith and support for the former CNRP, wasting my time. Lots of money and even more problems for yourself and your family.
The three former CNRP leaders highlighted why they volunteered to join the CPP. They stated that they clearly saw that the country was prospering and that the people were living peacefully due to the thoughtful leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the Cambodian People's Party.
On the occasion of receiving applications for political participation from the three former CNRP leaders in Battambang province, Mr. You Serey Vuth, Mr. Samet's team warmly welcomed the awakening and returned to live with the CPP. Cambodians from the former leaders of the three former CNRP parties.
Mr. You Serey Vuth called the decision of the three former CNRP leaders as the right decision to join the CPP in building and developing a more prosperous Cambodian society.
Mr. You Serey Vuth said that the path of the Cambodian People's Party, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, always puts the interests of the nation and the people first, and all activities are always thinking of the nation and the people as a priority.
A former CNRP leader in Battambang province who asked to join the CPP in political activities has declared his loyalty to the CPP and is working hard with the CPP to win the election.
New CPP members from the three former opposition parties have also announced their support for Dr. Hun Manet as the future prime ministerial candidate.
Over the past year, the trees of the two princes 'efforts in Bun Rany Sen Chey village, Damnak Troyeung, have gradually started to bear fruit, while all 628 veterans' families have received gifts from their homes, and their lives have improved. Before.
It should be reminded that Bun Rany Sen Chey Damnak Troyeung village is a new village in Prongel commune, Phnom Kravanh district, Pursat province, which was established in March 2021, after Samdech Techo Hun Sen provided more than 900 hectares of social land concessions for division. To 628 veterans and their families, a total of 628 families have lived and built a new life.
It should be informed that the third phase of house donations to veterans was made on March 18, 2022, with 328 houses, a total of 628 houses. In addition to the construction of houses, the Cambodian Red Cross has provided more than 30 new building materials, most of which are groceries.
In fact, the people in Bun Rany Sen Chey village, Damnak Troyeung, have improved their lives as they do today due to the attention and support from the authorities from the beginning, including Mr. Mao Thunin on behalf of the special envoy of Samdech The honorary doctor who, when he was the governor of Pursat province, also provided a lot of support to support their livelihood.
Not only that, Mr. Mao Thunin also plans to encourage veterans to work hard to grow their crops, and he will create a market to buy and sell on the spot, which means to collect agricultural products from the people in this village directly so that people do not worry about Lack of market for agricultural products.
The senior minister also called on the relevant authorities to preserve the land at the Veterans' Retreat as community land for veterans to distribute when they have children and lack land and housing, while this community land is only given to veterans who There are only real shortcomings.
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of March 21, 2022, Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia and Special Envoy of the ASEAN Chair, met with General Min Ong Lang, Chairman of the Council. State Administration of the Republic of the Union of Myanmar. This is according to the announcement of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.
The Ministry of Foreign Affairs claimed that during the meeting, the two sides discussed and exchanged views on the implementation and progress of the ASEAN Five-Point Agreement after the visit of Prime Minister Hun Sen in January this year.
It should be noted that on March 21, Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, as the Special Envoy of the ASEAN Chair, began to lead a delegation on his first working visit to Myanmar. The visit will last for three days from March 21 to 23, 2022 at the invitation of the State Administrative Council of the Republic of the Union of Myanmar after the country's leader, Min Aung Lan, agreed to There are some compromises.
Cambodia and Japan yesterday issued a statement urging Myanmar's military leaders to implement the five-point unanimous agreement as soon as possible and facilitate the distribution of humanitarian aid to the people of Myanmar.
The following is a summary of the Ministry of National Defense's 19 vaccination program: Closing prices in riel in supermarkets helps young people become interested in using the national riel.
(Phnom Penh): Ms. Chea Serey, Technical Director General of the National Bank of Cambodia, said that changing the price tag on shopping malls, companies and supermarkets from the dollar to the riel will make the younger generation more interested. Use of Riel.
Ms. Chea Serey's remarks were made on the occasion of participating in the celebration of the 42nd Anniversary of the Riel, which was held at Chip Mong Sen Sok Shopping Mall on March 20, 2022.
Ms. Chea Serey said that in the past, the Ministry of Commerce has issued a press release on the price tag in riel, but the implementation seems to be a bit slow, although the implementation is a bit slow, but there are still many shops and companies. Understand the value of the riel and have already applied for labeling the price of goods in riel.
"Obviously, like Lucky supermarket, the price is closed in riel and customers can pay in riel," she said. Recently I also saw a well-known maternity clothing store that has just opened in Cambodia, we also closed its prices in riel, this is a positive point and I think will make the children and young people notice. And interested in the riel.
She added that the use of the riel has not yet had a strong participation from young people, however, still hope that through the promotion of the National Bank from the relevant partners, combined with modern payment devices such as the system. Bakong, etc. will revive the activities of using the riel.
Mr. Pen Sovicheat, Undersecretary of State and spokesman for the Ministry of Commerce, said that at present, there are supermarkets and companies, including some small and large marts, have implemented the closing price in riel. Of course, the price tag is enclosed in US dollars, but the exact amount of the riel is clearly stated, as macro markets display the price tag in both the riel and the dollar.
He added that the promotion of the use of riel price tags in riel by the Ministry of Commerce and related partners has reached a sign of success, not only shops, companies or marts, but also gas stations closed. The price is in KHR and there is participation from banks through payment in KHR as well.
Mr. Pen Sovichet stated, "The Ministry of Commerce will continue this activity on both online and physical sales in order to promote the general use of the riel. "As long as the use of more will make the younger generation accept the riel payment as their means of payment both now and in the future."
Phal Vandy, executive director of the Cambodian Microfinance Association, said the riel had played an important role in strengthening the national economy. The association has promoted the use of the riel by requiring members of the association to provide more riel loans.
He continued that under the implementation and contribution of the people, it was found that the microfinance association provided loans in riel about 20 percent more than the requirement set by the National Bank of Cambodia to provide loans in at least 10 riel. This increase reflects the efforts of both the association and its members and the people on promoting the use of the riel.
