Russia claims that racist Ukraine has banned the use of the Russian language and has committed genocidal crimes against people of Russian descent in Donbass, which is already an independent Russian state.
The Russian military operation in Ukraine is not aimed at attacking civilians and to avoid bombing civilian areas is aimed only at Ukrainian military bases. Russia does not want to occupy Ukraine, just wants Ukraine to be neutral and not join NATO.
