Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon pays first visit to Myanmar on behalf of ASEAN Special Envoy
(Phnom Penh): This morning, March 21, 2022, Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia, left Cambodia for his first working visit to Myanmar as the Special Envoy of the ASEAN Chair. .
The visit will last for three days from March 21 to 23, 2022 at the invitation of the State Administrative Council of the Republic of the Union of Myanmar after the country's leader, Min Aung Lan, agreed to There are some compromises.
Accompanying Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon are Senior Minister Cham Prasidh, Minister of Industry, Science, Technology and Innovation; ) And a number of senior government officials, as well as staff of the ASEAN Secretariat and the AHA Center.
The Ministry claims that this visit will be based on the basic documents of the ASEAN Five-Point Consensus Agreement, the result of the working visit of Samdech Techo Prime Minister Hun Sen to Myanmar on January 7-8, 2022, the result of Discussion between Samdech Techo Prime Minister Hun Sen and Senior General Ming Ong Lang and the outcome of the recent ASEAN Foreign Ministers' Meeting.
Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the Inauguration Ceremony of Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital Preah Kosomak
(Phnom Penh): Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital Preah Kosomak, a hospital equipped with modern medical equipment, has been completed and will be officially inaugurated on Monday, March 21, 2022.
The inauguration ceremony of a new modern hospital in Phnom Penh was presided over by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Wang Vinthean, Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia.
The Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital Preah Kosomak, commonly known as Lok Sang Hospital by Cambodians, was built and equipped at a cost of more than 80 million US dollars with a grant from the Chinese government.
On the occasion of the inauguration, Samdech Techo Hun Sen gave a speech for about 40 minutes, the following are the main contents:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is really happy with the doctors and the whole Cambodian people for the achievement of the Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital Preah Kosomak, a hospital equipped with modern medical equipment.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital Preah Kosomak was born from the good relations between Cambodia and China.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that when he was a child, Samdech used to come to Preah Kosomak Hospital for treatment.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants the Ministry of Health to study the possibility of kidney transplant surgery in the country, while Cambodia has the ability to make this transplant legal.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that he will inaugurate the roads in Siem Reap and inspect the construction site of the airport in Siem Reap in early April.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the hospital is good, but doctors and treatment must strive to do well.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that building the capacity of doctors is important, along with strengthening professional ethics to ensure better treatment.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the announcement of additional assistance of 20 million doses of Kovid 19 vaccine from the Chinese government is to ensure that Cambodia guarantees the number of vaccines to be given to the people against Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia does not discriminate against the presence of vaccines, any country that gives Cambodia to accept all.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advised to prepare a rolling plan to vaccinate children up to 3 years old.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the medical team to maintain the hospital and all the facilities in the Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital Preah Kosomak to ensure long-term use.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Chinese government and people for supporting the reform of Preah Kosomak Hospital to improve treatment.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had apologized to the Chinese President on behalf of the Cambodian students who fled China when China was hit by the Kovid 19 epidemic.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are 23 Cambodian families living in Ukraine. Samdech has no instructions to evacuate those people, but to mourn with the government and the people of Ukraine.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed Cambodian doctors to understand and take advantage of traditional Chinese medicine used to treat Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this medicine is widely used in China as well as in developed economies, especially in the Middle East.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also recommended cooperation with China to accelerate vaccine production.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech shared his experience with many friendly countries related to the fight against Kovid 19. Samdech Techo stated that the success of Cambodia is vaccination, and that vaccination is based on the strategy of flowering, that is, vaccination to create resilience in the community.
