The Cambodian-Chinese Friendship Hospital Preah Kosomak, formerly known as the Orthopedic Hospital, is now being further modernized in addition to its surgical expertise with state-of-the-art medical equipment. The hospital is also equipped with advanced medical equipment for recording for diagnosis, which is an important part of supporting treatment.
