Added 323 new members of the Cambodian People's Party in Sangkat Prek Leap, Khan Chroy Changva
(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian People's Party (CPP) in Chroy Changvar district on the morning of March 20, 2022, announced the inclusion of 323 new members under the Prek Leap Sangkat Party Committee under the chairmanship of Mr. Khleang Huot, President of the CPP in Chroy Changvar district and Mr. Bun Vuthea, Chairman of Prek Leap Sangkat Assistance Team, with the participation of Khan Party Leaders, Sangkat Assistance Team, Sangkat Party and about 350 relevant members.
Speaking at the announcement ceremony, Mr. Khleang Huot said that only the Cambodian People's Party fought to liberate and save the nation from the Pol Pot regime in 1979 and ended the war completely in 1998 under The launch of Samdech Techo Hun Sen's win-win policy has brought peace, unity, stability, freedom, democracy, the rule of law and development in all areas.
He added that the Cambodian People's Party is committed to the interests of the nation and the people as a whole and strives to maintain the invaluable peace and prevent the return of war. . Through the achievements of the party left over the past 43 years, it can be confirmed that the Cambodian People's Party is the only party that has great merits in the cause of national defense, religion, the King and the people.
On that occasion, Mr. Khleang Huot emphasized that the decision of the new members was not because they saw the benefits of merit or religious rewards, but because they respected the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and to join in protecting peace with the Cambodian People's Party.
He said that this is the right decision to choose the leader of the country responsibly as a voter.
Taking the opportunity, he said that the word "peace" sounds easy to say, but in reality peace is very difficult to find a country to achieve complete peace, it will take decades, but if the destruction of peace. It is only in the blink of an eye if we choose the wrong leader.
Mr. Khleang Huot also instructed the new members of the Cambodian People's Party to participate in safeguarding peace, protecting the achievements of the society and to participate in activities to serve the social interests well at the local level and to be committed to serving the Cambodian People's Party in the election. To the Cambodian People's Party to continue to support Samdech Techo Hun Sen as the next Prime Minister and to support Dr. Hun Manet as the future Prime Minister.
