Ms. Chea Serey said, "The use of the riel in electronic systems, especially in the Bakong system introduced by the National Bank of Cambodia, has seen an increase in payments in riel, but in percentage terms less than the dollar, but growth. "I hope that the introduction of Bakong and other electronic payment systems will make the riel payment easier and more profitable."
