4 killed and 1 injured in car-truck accident in Svay Rieng
(Svay Rieng): Four people were killed at the scene and one person was injured in a traffic accident between a dump truck and a Highlander truck at dawn on March 19, 2022 at the corner of a four-lane road in the village. Bak Ronas Village, Sangkat Sangkor, Svay Rieng City, Svay Rieng Province.
Lieutenant Colonel Ken Rithy, Police Inspector of Svay Rieng City, this horrific traffic accident caused four people to die immediately at the scene and another suffered minor injuries. The accident was caused by a dump truck driving without respecting the right of way.
The inspector confirmed that prior to the incident, a dump truck was traveling from north to south, when it arrived at the scene, the intersection of four corners collided with a Highlander truck traveling from east to west. Anger at once.
After the incident, the authorities arrived and measured the bodies of the four victims handed over to their families for the traditional ceremony, while the injured were sent to the provincial hospital.
