On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for more than an hour, the following are the main contents of Samdech Techo:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng for supporting the construction of SOS Children's Village to provide care and living for orphans and underprivileged children.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has done a lot of work for children. Samdech Techo stated that in the world there are no child victims like Cambodia because of the genocidal regime of Pol Pot.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is proud of its efforts to help children without leaving child victims behind.
* Samdech Techo stated that about 4 children raised by SOS Children became doctors, 6 became engineers, 7 became bank employees, 3 became architects, 2 became designers. And many others have become employees in the business, customer service and government sectors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has done a lot of work for children. In that, Cambodia only creates support programs for orphans. But Cambodia also cares for mothers and children in need. Since 2019, more than 250,000 mothers and children have received financial support from pregnancy to the age of two.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is looking to increase subsidies for mothers and children in poor families from pregnancy to 2 years old when the Cambodian economy is better.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had built a center for girls victims of father abuse and also built a school for blind and deaf children as a result of the Royal Government's efforts.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that, like Samdech and Samdech Krala Hom, he was born in a difficult situation, but his efforts also became a national leader.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that Samdech used to blame some foreigners who advised Cambodia, Samdech replied that they only have a chance to be born in a rich country, but the ability is not sure that stronger than the Cambodian people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that when there was an outbreak of Kovid 19, some media and countries underestimated that Cambodia would face a bad situation because of Kovid 19. But in the end, Cambodia became a good country to control the Kovid 19 epidemic.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia decided to cancel the certification of 19 Kovid on PCR machines before entering Cambodia for 72 hours.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia also decided to cancel the quick test upon arrival in Cambodia and allow the resumption of the issuance of visas on arrival for international travelers.
* Samdech Techo stated that this decision is to facilitate travel to and from Cambodia for people, for international guests and business people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia will hold the Second Global Dialogue on ASEAN issues with the participation of ASEAN Member States and partner countries and stakeholders with ASEAN.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is writing a detailed book related to Samdech's national leadership process. Samdech Techo confirmed that this book has tens of thousands of pages.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Prey Veng has changed a lot in the past and now. Prey Veng now extends to universities.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised and thanked the leaders and government officials of Prey Veng for their joint efforts to develop Prey Veng.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the past, Samdech and national leaders traveled to many provinces to address the work and nation building.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reprimanded a number of analysts who misrepresented the work of the ASEAN-US Special Summit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the ASEAN Chair has no right to set a time for the ASEAN-US Special Summit, only to mediate with ASEAN members.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in April, Samdech could go to Japan for a meeting on water issues.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there is no specific time for the ASEAN-US Summit yet, leaving Indonesia as the mediator.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he hopes that doctors, analysts and professors will go back to study ASEAN affairs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that ASEAN is considering training from ASEAN to increase awareness and improve ASEAN cooperation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that all possibilities of cooperation with ASEAN countries, ASEAN and partners to expand Cambodia's exports.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia can meet at any time, Cambodia can postpone work in the country. Samdech Techo asked not to say that Cambodia does not want to meet with the United States.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praises SOS, which is not forced to respect religion. Samdech Techo considered this a special point of SOS. Samdech Techo suggested that other organizations should follow this organization. Samdech Techo considers the restriction on religion in donor countries is a violation of Cambodian law, which stipulates freedom of religion.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if any Ukrainian people fled to Cambodia, Cambodia would accept it.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reiterated that Cambodia does not support volunteering for the war in Ukraine.
