The Governor of Stong District also instructed all vendors to display or sell at the location and place designated by the authorities to maintain order, public order and good environmental hygiene in the market area. The whole free stream.
Finally, the Governor of Stong District added that in order for this work to be done well, there must be a responsible participation of business people, local authorities, the public and all stakeholders. In addition, do not sell on drains and put waste or rubbish into the drains, which can cause clogging of the drains and cause bad odors.
