In his opening remarks at the 19th ASEAN Military Intelligence Meeting, Lt. Gen. Hun Manit hailed the organization of this important meeting and thanked the presence of the delegations of the Military Intelligence Institutions of ASEAN Member States for the regular meeting. Although Kovid 19 has spread globally over the past two years. This action is a testament to the spirit of good cooperation, solidarity and friendship of ASEAN member countries.
