(Preah Sihanouk): On March 15, 2022, a working group of the Department of Private Security Management led by Lt. Gen. Lim Sokharasmey, Director of the Department, visited a meeting to practice private security management at the Sihanoukville Provincial Police.
The meeting was also attended by the Commissioner for Security Planning, the Chief-Deputy Chief of the Private Security Management Office of the Sihanoukville Provincial Police and representatives of private security companies targeting Sihanoukville.
