* Second: Continue to monitor and investigate crimes in vulnerable targets
* Third: Check the profile of private security agents clearly. Senior Official of the Ministry of Public Works Denies Allegations of Mobile Officers Arresting Overweight Trucks in Takeo Province
(Takeo): A senior official of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport has denied allegations by some traders that its mobile officers seized overweight trucks by applying the law unfairly and involved money for food. This is a false accusation. However, all traders are requested to strictly abide by the road rules and avoid being fined if they are found to be overweight.
In addition, the working group also educated the owners of overweight vehicles to understand the procedure of fines for overweight transport, the limits set out in Article 60 of the Law on Roads and Requests. To all car owners, stop overloading this limit because overweight is a disaster on the road and serious traffic accidents.
During the operation, Mr. Kimsan also explained to the car owners to understand the rules of overweight transport (road rules) and request not to overweight because overweight has caused a disaster. To the national road and serious traffic accidents.
According to Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, the team will proceed with the procedure without understanding anyone if it is found that the trucks dare to overweight. The operation will continue throughout the country to restrict transportation in accordance with the law to prevent criminals from arbitrarily destroying roads.
It should be informed that the Ministry of Public Works and Transport has detained 147 overweight trucks as of today, after Samdech Techo announced the release of all vehicles earlier.
Honorary Legal Officer Dr. Sim Ka sends congratulatory message to Ms. Nhem Sakhorn Sar Kheng on the occasion of her 66th birthday
(Phnom Penh): Honorary Legal Officer Dr. Sim Ka, First Vice President of the Senate of Cambodia, sent a message of congratulations to Ms. Nhem Sakhorn Sar Kheng on the occasion of her 66th birthday and 77th birthday, which took place on March 15, 2022.
In his congratulatory letter, Dr. Sim Ka stated, "My wife and I would like to express our happiness on the occasion of the 66th birthday of Lok Chumteav on March 15. In this year 2022, I wish you good health, physical strength, bright intellect, wisdom and long life.
Mr. Kitti Nitikosal Bandith further stated that her noble spirit, which has always been as a deep and enduring social wife, has accompanied and is one of the most important driving forces in motivating Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng to participate. The historic mission of liberating the nation, the motherland and the people from the genocidal regime to regain peace and political stability throughout the country.
She always sacrificed her strength, mind, wisdom and spirit to serve the national interests, religion, the King with pure and pure generosity to build and develop the society to prosper forever.
My wife and I would like to pray to all the sacred objects in the three merits of Preah Ratanatray Keo, the guardian deity of the Kingdom of Cambodia. Class, happiness, strength, do not be lazy. Senior Minister Osman Hassan sends condolence message to Duke Ing Bunhou over the death of Lim Chhun
