Ministry of Justice Releases Results of Workshops and Roundtable Programs for Training and Dissemination of Anti-Financing Law
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Justice on March 14, 2022 issued a press release announcing the results of the Roundtable Workshop and Roundtable Program to Disseminate and Train the Anti-Financing Law on the Subcommittee on Genocide. Commission on the implementation of the action plan of the Joint Monitoring Group of the Asia-Pacific Group on International Cooperation.
