(Phnom Penh): General Ith Sarath, Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Joint Chiefs of Staff of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, confirmed that the Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF) is ready for the 19th ASEAN Commander-in-Chief Meeting under the theme "Solidarity". For Peaceful Harmony ”and related meetings in Cambodia 2022, which will be held from 16 to 18 March to be successful.
