Please be informed that the contents of the 16th ASEAN Defense Ministers 'Meeting and related meetings in 2022 chaired by Cambodia include: Priority theme, review of concept documents, discussion documents and calendar schedule for the preparation of the ASEAN Defense Ministers' Meeting 16th and related meetings in 2022, which are scheduled to be held in both Phnom Penh and Siem Reap.
