Mr. Kong Sophoan said that out of the 282 affected families, 172 families were partially affected by the construction and were able to continue living in the old location and 110 families were completely affected. Out of land for housing reconstruction) 7 families have asked to live on the old site with the remaining land in the back of the canal.
