(Phnom Penh): General Chhum Socheat, Secretary of State and spokesman for the Ministry of National Defense, on March 12, 2022, completely denied the media coverage and confirmed that Huon Seiha was not his assistant.
General Chhum Socheat confirmed to Fresh News that "some media outlets have recently published information about Huon Seiha and claimed to be my assistant, using my name for personal gain through "Taking money in exchange for the inclusion of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces."
He continued, "I completely reject this unconfirmed advertisement and please confirm that I have never had an assistant named Huon Seiha like the advertisement." "All of Huon Seiha's actions are purely personal and should not be publicized to the detriment of my honor and the Ministry of National Defense."
On this issue, General Chhum Socheat also requested and called on all media outlets that published this erroneous information to correct their publication. At the same time, he also called on the relevant authorities to take action to investigate and punish the perpetrators in accordance with legal procedures.
Please be informed that the statement of General Chhum Socheat was made after it was reported that a person named Huon Seiha used his name to deceive the people.
