Stung Treng Provincial Authority Confiscates Land After Invasion
(Stung Treng): Stung Treng provincial administration officials led a force to confiscate the reserve land of the Ministry of Agriculture from a small number of people who invaded and occupied in Ban Bung village, Phluk commune, Sesan district, Stung Treng province.
