Paralympic Games, a platform for people with disabilities to show their spirit and strong will to the world
The potential of people with disabilities is limitless. The Paralympic Games are a testament to the fact that our society is designed to provide an equal platform like the Olympics for people with disabilities so that they can find the light of life, overcome obstacles to achieve their dreams. Especially to share the fun and friendship that comes from sports with athletes from all over the world.
In this Paralympic event, there is no discrimination, no hostility, no political maneuvering, only friendship and solidarity, as well as sincere applause and sincere appreciation for the outstanding performance of all disabled athletes who are the model of the common destiny community. Only one.
With the support and encouragement of the Chinese government, many people with disabilities participate in both summer and winter sports training, which has made significant progress in the cause of disability sports in China. At the Beijing Paralympics, for example, 96 athletes competed in all disciplines, the largest number in the history of the Games, which previously had just over 20 participants.
