(Kampong Speu): General Ith Sarath, Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Joint Chiefs of Staff of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, reminded all officers, deputies and soldiers at the Special Command to continue to participate in preventing any person who intends to destroy the peace. And continue to maintain the peace that was hard earned by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
