(Phnom Penh): In the next few months, the General Department of Taxation will introduce a system to manage real estate ID codes for Borey or apartment construction companies. Be transparent for taxpayers.
The introduction of the General Department of Taxation's real estate code management system is fully supported by real estate experts.
Oknha Cheng Kheng, CEO of CPL Real Estate, sees the development of the real estate ID system as a good thing for both the public and private sectors, and easier for the real estate sector to know the details and manage risks. .
"The key to creating this code system is to show equality for taxpayers and to make it easier for taxpayers," he said.
Mr. Chrek Soknim, President of the Cambodian Association of Real Estate Appraisers, said that the General Department of Taxation's introduction of a property identification code system is a mechanism to maintain the accuracy of taxpayers' tax payments, which means that tax payments There is equality.
He added that the ID system has many benefits, both taxable and public, as it provides management data to homebuyers one by one, as the public can know the tax payment and history of the home they will buy. Through the real estate ID system, it is good for both buyers and sellers because it is clear.
Please be informed that according to the confirmation of the General Department of Taxation, the property ID management system for Sang Borey or this apartment can be operational at the end of April or the beginning of May 2022, while currently the General Department of Taxation Developing this application.
