(Pursat): 8 suspects were chased by the working group of Krakor District Administrative Unity Command, with the participation of Pursat Fisheries Administration and the joint forces, chasing and catching them day and night while fishing with illegal equipment. Freshwater trawl law combined with shock in the middle of the Tonle Sap Lake.
