According to the Pursat Provincial Fisheries Officer, after receiving the voice message of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, about the case of active electric shock every night in the Tonle Sap Lake area in Kampong Luong commune, Krakor district, Mr. Chiao Tai, Governor of Pursat Province and Chairman of the Provincial Administrative Unity Command, has issued a strict order, with all levels of forces cracking down on this crime.
At the same time, the coalition forces conducted a three-day operation to hunt down and arrest the perpetrators while fishing with illegal fishing nets, dragging fresh water and electric shocks, and chased the ghosts to the other side until they were able to arrest people. 08 people.
