(Kandal): Residents of Prek Ta Dol village, Po commune, have demanded that a judge release their jailed representative and drop the charges against 10 other villagers after a land dealer filed a lawsuit over their dispute. 5 hectares of land after accusing each other In this case, the investigating judge of Kandal Provincial Court, Mr. Blong Visal, decided to detain a citizen named Srang Srei temporarily.
The rally in front of Kandal Provincial Court took place on March 7, 2022.
