(Phnom Penh): Mr. Vongsey Visoth, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister and Permanent Secretary of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, on the morning of March 9, 2022, opened a training course on online performance budgeting (Zoom). To a total of 600 trainees as trainers and budget officers from all ministries and institutions.
This training course is designed to provide additional knowledge on the principles and methods of budgeting, achievements that ministries and institutions will be piloted for budget preparation in 2023 in accordance with the time frame of implementation of the action plan of the 2018 budget reform strategy. 2025. This important training course lasts for 3 days.
Mr. Vongsey Visoth said that this training will also help to fill some gaps, including updating the knowledge of budget trainers in ministries and institutions related to program structure, indicator setting, budget unit organization and budget analysis. Provide programs and priorities to improve the quality of budget allocation and develop key performance indicators.
He pointed out that the achievement budget is not a new job and is very different from the program budget that the ministries and institutions are currently implementing. Achievement budget is the preparation of a budget package linked to information on achievements that are planned or achieved by the Ministry.
In this sense, performance information plays an important role, however, is not yet an absolute determinant of decision making in a complete budget allocation, ie performance information is a basic component that must be used in conjunction with other relevant information. And the economic, social and policy priorities of the Royal Government as a common basis for decision-making on budget allocation or allocation of resources to ministries and institutions.
In addition, another difference is that the performance budget to be prepared will have a clearer definition of performance indicators at the program structure level, both the setting of annual performance indicators and the final outcome indicators that the ministry-institution plans to Decided.
Mr. Vongsy Visoth also mentioned that this achievement budget can provide flexibility in creating a program structure based on or not entirely on the administrative structure, but requires measuring the effectiveness and efficiency of the program through linked performance indicators. Between the year results and the final results clearly.
He stressed that any ministry that organizes and manages the budget well, the ministry will receive more authority. Commentary: China's National People's Congress convenes positive signs for global economic development
