Preah Sasan Sophoan Hoeum Sovannara stated that seeing that the Oddar Kiri Andet pagoda in Preah Vihear province does not yet have a Buddha image to be kept as a shrine, the leadership of the monks of the sub-district of Rolea Bier district, Kampong Chhnang province, advertised for the generosity of the Buddhists. Participate generously to build a Buddha image for the procession to be kept at Wat Oddar Kiri Andet, Preah Vihear Province.
Preah Sasan Sophoan Hoeum Sovannara continued that because the people of Buddhism near and far are followers of Buddhism, they have been very generous with the merits of the Buddha in building 361 Buddha statues made of copper metal. He performed the wedding ceremony and marched all these Buddha statues from Kampong Chhnang province to be deposited in Wat Oddar Kiri Tuol Andet in Thnal Bek village, Thmey commune, Kulen district, Preah Vihear province.
