(Pursat): After one year of starting the development of Bun Rany Sen Chey Damnak Troyeung village on Monday, March 7, 2022, Ms. Men Neary Sopheak, First Deputy Secretary General of the Cambodian Red Cross and her colleagues, together with the Cambodian Veterans Association Pursat Province inspected the progress mail and visited the village team and veterans' families living in Bun Rany Sen Chey village, Damnak Troyeung, Prongel commune, Phnom Kravanh district, Pursat province.
