She also informed the direction and mission of the Cambodian Red Cross, which works as an assistant to the public authority in the field of humanitarian, with a volunteer force at the local level as a direct operator. In this regard, she recommended the recruitment of Cambodian Red Cross volunteers in the village as a force to provide humanitarian services to alleviate the hardships of our people and contribute to strengthening the resilience of the community.
