(Phnom Penh): The specialized police force successfully cooperated in splitting the murder case of a Chinese woman in Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville, Preah Sihanouk Province on the night of March 7, 2022. Arrested in Kbal Damrey 2 village, Sangkat Kakap II, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh, after acting on February 28, 2022.
The operation was carried out under the direct command of General Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner, Lt. Gen. Nheng Chuor, Director of the Criminal Police Department, and Lt. Gen. Chuon Narin, Sihanoukville Provincial Police Commissioner. Coordinated by Mr. Plang Sophal, Deputy Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court and Preah Sihanouk Provincial Prosecutor.
In this case, the Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Force, under the direction and command of the Major General, conducted an eight-day search until it was discovered that the perpetrators were hiding in Po Sen Chey District and asked for cooperation with the Phnom Penh Criminal Police Force and specialized forces. Criminal Department to catch the perpetrators.
After receiving the order, the police force of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police (the owner of the case) requested to cooperate with the Criminal Department and Police Inspectorate of Po Sen Chey District of Phnom Penh Municipal Police until the afternoon of March 7, 2022. The suspect's hiding place was taken to Man Sikong Hotel in Kbal Damrey 2 Village, Sangkat Kakap II, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
Currently, the perpetrator has been handed over to the Preah Sihon Provincial Police Commissioner, who is the owner of the case, to build a case for further proceedings.
