The class forum was held on the afternoon of March 6, 2022 at the Kampong Cham Provincial Documentation Center, with the participation of a total of 20 students from Tamang High School, Peam Chi Kong High School and Sihanoukville High School.
Mr. Seang Chenda, Director of the Kampong Cham Documentation Center, spoke about the importance of studying the history of Democratic Kampuchea, as well as the establishment of the Kampong Cham Documentation Center, which has a rich archive of documents related to the Khmer Rouge regime and provides educational programs on Khmer Rouge history.
