Cambodia has achieved complete peace as it does today, its people are living in peace and happiness because of the peaceful negotiations with the win-win policy in 1998, if there were no peaceful negotiations for peace, maybe now Cambodia may be at war. It is possible that at this time, the Prince also called for dialogue and a peaceful solution to the Russia-Ukraine issue.
