The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia stated, "This hospital is not only serving the people of Tbong Khmum, but part of Prey Veng, Stung Treng, Ratanakkiri and Mondulkiri provinces are covered by this hospital." "Now this achievement has begun."
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital Tbong Khmum is another new achievement of Cambodia under the good friendship and cooperation between Cambodia and China. The spacious building of the Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital, Tbong Khmum, will respond better to support the well-being of the people.
Under the strong friendship and financial support from the Chinese government and people, the construction of the Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital in Tbong Khmum Province began in 2019. Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Mr. Wang Vin Thean, Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia and the people of Tbong Khmum Province witnessed the official opening of the hospital on March 1, 2019. .
Tbong Khmum Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital was built on an area of 24,300 square meters on a total area of 55,815 square meters. The hospital has spent nearly $ 50 million in grants from the Chinese government and people. The hospital has 9 interconnected buildings, including 5-storey inpatient ward, 5-storey maternity and pediatric ward, 2-storey medical building, administrative and residential building and other buildings. Another 1 floor.
The hospital is equipped with state-of-the-art medical equipment, which is equipped with the latest technology and international standards. The hospital also uses digital technology to manage patients, which improves the delivery of patients.
