Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Those who have never been to Cambodia, they will be amazed at the progress and development of society under the roof of peace (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Speaking on the forum in Tbong Khmum province, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia "If you have never been to Cambodia, when you come to Cambodia, you will be amazed at the growth and development of Cambodian society under the umbrella of complete peace," he said.
Cambodia, a country plagued by the flames of war and the devastation of the Democratic Kampuchea regime, has devastated its welfare infrastructure. After the Democratic Kampuchea regime, or so-called Khmer Rouge regime, was overthrown on January 7, 1979, the Royal Government of Cambodia made great efforts to rebuild its infrastructure.
On the occasion of the inauguration of the Cambodia-China Tbong Khmum Friendship Hospital on Monday morning, March 7, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen said: "For those who have not come to Cambodia for a while. To Cambodia in the new period, it is clear that there will be a unique development and development of Cambodian society, even this location (Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital, Tbong Khmum), so at this point we are solving the problem ... "
At the same time, Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that in 1998, Cambodians had a life expectancy of only 56 years, but now life expectancy is more than 70 years. This hope is due to the factors of peace, infrastructure development, livelihood growth and the development of the health care system.
The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia continued that the achievements that Cambodia is achieving today is due to the country's complete peace in the country, in addition to the achievements that Cambodia is having, all Cambodians are guaranteed. On well-being, business, and other opportunities under this one roof of peace.
In addition to the development, Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the hospital has modern facilities is important, but what is more important is the professional conscience of doctors. Samdech hopes that all doctors will make efforts to pay attention to the health and rescue of patients.
It should be noted that from 1998 to the present, it has been only 24 years since Cambodia achieved full peace, brought about national unity and provided an opportunity for the country plagued by this chronic war to develop itself. The poor have finally reached an optimal stage as they are today.
Many achievements have been made, especially in the last two decades, under the tireless efforts, dedication and reform of the Royal Government of Cambodia, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, under the umbrella of complete peace. The Cambodian people clearly see the achievements that come from this peace and welcome the presence of peace and wish for a permanent presence on this Cambodian territory.
As for the Cambodian population under the age of 40, about 60% of the total population of more than 16 million people are enjoying the benefits of peace, civilized life in accordance with social development and economic growth.
Due to the peace, Cambodia's economy has been growing at around 7% per year for 20 consecutive years, which has moved Cambodia from a poor country to a low middle income country and become a middle middle income country. High in 2030 and high income in 2050.
