Senior Minister Ly Thuch considers youth as the property of the nation and a leader for the future of the nation
(Svay Rieng): During a meeting with members of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, Bavet City, Svay Rieng Province on March 6, 2022, Senior Minister Ly Thuch considered the youth as a national asset, a driving force, a hope and a class. Lead for the future of the nation.
The Senior Minister praised and appreciated the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, led by Mr. HUN Many as President, as well as the Svay Rieng Provincial Union and the Bavet City Union under the leadership of Mr. Dy Vichea. Active work for the motherland, social work and education, especially to participate in the successful fight against Kovid-19 under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
The Senior Minister emphasized to all the youth that the gratitude and gratitude of the youth to the leadership is a reflection for the growth and development of the nation, and at the same time, the youth must not forget the merits of the parents who gave birth. And nurture, nurture and appreciate teachers for their education and discipline.
The Senior Minister considered the youth to be the property of the nation, the driving force, the hope and a leader for the future of the country. Its mission is to be a compass to help orient and set the direction for success in life and must be loyal to the motherland.
The senior minister said that the nation is like a beautiful flower garden and the youth are like a bunch of flowers in a flower garden. Each flower has different scents, different colors, different sizes, but when combined, it can form a beautiful flower garden or a beautiful bouquet.
CPP in Chroy Changvar District Recognizes Chairman of Bak Kheng Sangkat Party Committee and Adds 517 New Members
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Khleang Huot, Chairman of the CPP Committee in Chroy Changvar District, instructed the Chairman of the Party of Sangkat Bak Kheng and 517 newly elected members of the Cambodian People's Party to protect the peace and achievements of the society and contribute to the benefits. For the benefit of the people in the local community to gain the respect, love, satisfaction and support of the people.
Kong Bunly, the newly-appointed Chairman of Bak Kheng Sangkat Party and a representative of the newly formed members, has now pledged his loyalty to the CPP and voted for the CPP to continue to support Samdech Techo Hun Sen. As the next Prime Minister and support Mr. Hun Manet as the future Prime Minister.
Mr. Khleang Huot said that through the achievements of the party over the past 43 years, starting from the January 7 victory, the Cambodian People's Party has achieved unimaginable social change. He said that the win-win policy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen has brought peace, unity, stability, freedom, democracy, the rule of law and development in all areas, so that all people can live in harmony under the roof of the same constitution.
He added that the decision of the newly elected members was the right one and asked the new members of the Cambodian People's Party to participate in protecting peace, protecting the achievements of the society and actively participating in good activities. Serve the interests of society at the local level to gain the respect, love, satisfaction and support of the people.
Mr. Khleang Huot appealed to all members who have not been vaccinated against Kovid-19 doses to get vaccinated immediately, especially those who have been given a second dose and then given a third dose and those who have been vaccinated. Thirdly, a fourth dose must be given to increase the Kovid-19 immune system to be more effective and to continue to promote and encourage local people to get vaccinated.
At the same time, Mr. Khleang Huot also donated 12,990,000 Riels for the ceremony and to the new members, including party shirts and hats. Dr. Hing Bun Heang and 632 women in Kandal Stung district celebrated. 111th Anniversary of International Women's Day March 8
