On that occasion, also read the message of Her Majesty Queen Norodom Monineath Sihanouk, the Queen Mother of Cambodia in freedom, dignity and happiness to her compatriots, especially to women throughout the Kingdom of Cambodia and women around the world on the occasion Celebrating the 111th Anniversary of International Women's Day, March 8, 2022.
He said that women have been very involved in all activities, contributing to the improvement of economic growth and social security. In addition, it has improved the living conditions, status, roles and values of women, as well as Cambodia's good morals, society, culture and traditions, and encouraged women to continue to participate in peacekeeping, socio-economic development and prevention of the spread of Kovid 19. Cambodia.
