At the same time, he encouraged new members participating in the program to observe the process and implementation of the CPP activities at the local level, as well as pay more attention to the party's political programs to be more confident.
He cited as an example the focus of the CPP's consideration of the environment in attracting investors, companies, factories to open factories and invest in the country, which brings a lot of work to you, especially in Kampong Speu. Is present in the program.
Also in this morning's program, Ms. Un Liza, a representative of the new party members, pledged that "the Cambodian People's Party is the only party that has liberated and saved the lives of the Cambodian people and led the country to continuous development. Especially bringing peace to the people. "I am proud to be a member and determined to abide by the party's rules, respect and follow the party from now on."
