Interior Ministry spokesman: 42 people arrested for criminal and drug offenses on March 2
(Phnom Penh): At least 42 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on March 2, 2022 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News this morning, March 3.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 42 suspects, 22 were arrested in nine criminal cases and 20 were arrested in 10 drug cases.
