According to the Ministry of Commerce, the application for e-commerce license will expire on March 1, 2022, but in response to requests from traders and companies, the ministry will delay the fine. This is until July 1, 2022.
At the same time, the Ministry of Commerce stated that businesses that conduct e-commerce operations without permission from the Ministry of Commerce will be fined and may be fined.
