Khmer Civilization Expert: The Ukraine-Russia War is a Diplomatic Chess Game of Political Geography
(Phnom Penh): Khmer civilization expert, Mr. Rath Sandab, said that now to the war that is raging in Ukraine on February 24, 2022, which makes the world is excited as we see this. It stems from the erroneous ambitions of the diplomatic game of US geopolitics, where the king sits on a NATO throne with the aim of turning Ukraine into a NATO stronghold to encircle Russia in Eastern Europe.
Because the security lines of the Russian armed powers were strictly defined after World War II. In fact, even in 1962, the United States sent missiles to Turkey, almost to the point of a deadly weapons war.
