* Continue to focus on reducing malaria, both falciparum and vivac. In fact, it is noted that the number of malaria cases has decreased by 97.5% from 2011 to 2021.
The last step in the eradication of malaria is the most important step in achieving the goal of eradicating malaria by 2025 and maintaining the non-recurrence of malaria in malaria-endemic areas. Available prior to the implementation of the Malaria Eradication Program.
