Key Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the Inauguration of National Road No. 3 Phnom Penh-Kampot
(Phnom Penh): The section of National Road No. 3 Phnom Penh-Kampot, more than 134 kilometers long, was officially inaugurated on March 2, 2022. The inauguration ceremony of this important achievement for the nation and the people of Cambodia was presided over by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Mr. Wang Vinthean, Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia.
During the inauguration ceremony, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for about 1 hour and 30 minutes, the following are the main contents of Samdech Techo:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the presence of National Road No. 3 is another new achievement, showing the cooperation and strategic partnership of all angles and common destiny.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that next week, Samdech and Mr. Wang Vinthean will inaugurate the Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital in Tbong Khmum Province, which is a great achievement of Cambodia-China cooperation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that at that time, Samdech told the former President of South Korea that the section of National Road No. 3 is very important because it is the road that connects to Cambodia's only salt-producing province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that due to the increase in traffic on National Road 3, Samdech decided to ask China to help rebuild.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the garden and flower planting in the middle of the road because it enhances the beauty and greenness of the road.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he expects that people will not use the road park as a place to defecate.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that during the construction phase of National Road No. 3, the people on both sides of the road were severely affected, but after the construction, the people on both sides of the road were the first to benefit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that a market owner next to National Road 3 used to oppose the construction of a bridge across the road, Samdech said that it must be done.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also praised the installation of speed cameras on National Road 3, which is a modernization of road construction.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that road construction in Cambodia has changed. Before, the road was built to make it long, but now it is to make it strong.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised Chinese companies for always moving faster than planned.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the people will benefit from this section of National Road No. 3 while Cambodia expands investment in the southwest of the country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his gratitude and appreciation to the Chinese government and people for always providing funds for the construction of infrastructure in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that so far, China has provided funds to build 29 roads with a length of more than 3,000 kilometers, and 3 roads with a length of 369 kilometers. Nine bridges have been completed, 8,565 meters long, and one bridge is under construction, the bridge across the Bassac River, connecting the third ring road 996 meters, worth $ 56 million. The Chinese government has provided nearly 3 billion US dollars for the construction of roads and bridges.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech has just released an additional $ 5 million from the national budget to address the impact on the construction of the Third Ring Road.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the morality of the authorities to the people living on the streets, the Royal Government must finally affect them.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that people who are stubborn for the impact on the national road construction project will have to implement the expropriation law.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people not to exceed the weight limit and not to drive over the speed limit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that just for fun and endangering life because driving is not appropriate.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the vaccine that saved him from contracting Kovid 19, despite direct contact with Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the people to join the fight against Kovid 19 by implementing the "3 prevent and 3 do not rule" and vaccinating all doses as planned.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the vaccine in the warehouse has more than 7 million doses and in the first half of this year will try to import another 8 million doses to ensure the injection to the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the ASEAN chairmanship in 2022 is not a simple matter. Problems have arisen in addition to the South China Sea, Myanmar, and now the Russia-Ukraine war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he did not support separatist activities and did not support the use of war to end the war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the war between Russia and Ukraine has now become a war between Russia and Europe.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the war between Russia and Ukraine will last longer if Russia keeps troops in Ukraine.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says he still believes that Russia and Ukraine have not run out of opportunities to negotiate. Samdech encourages negotiations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirms that what he said about the Russia-Ukraine war is in his personal opinion, not in the name of ASEAN
* Hun Sen stated that Russia and Ukraine will understand Cambodia's position and will not force Cambodia to choose this side or that side.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Russia-Ukraine war became an additional burden for the world economy while being plagued by Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian economy is being affected by Kovid 19 and may be further affected by the Russia-Ukraine war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if the Russian-Ukrainian war reaches the use of nuclear weapons, Europe, Russia and the United States may be destroyed.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is a long-time politician and has led the country not only during the peace process. But led the country from war to peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that peace is the highest priority policy of the Royal Government of Cambodia today. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if peace cannot be guaranteed, not to mention the development of human rights and democracy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech can find peace by ending the flames of war, but can not find peace of mind for the guilty.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the provision of weapons to Ukraine will intensify the Russia-Ukraine war.
