According to the spokesperson, as of March 1, 2022, the traffic police nationwide inspected and fined a total of 38,714 vehicles, including 29,366 motorcycles and 9,348 vehicles of all types.
Notable offenses for motorcycles are mostly helmet, phone, license plate, drunkenness and sign offenses. In particular, the car violated the speed, violated the sign, no driver's license, no license plate, drunk, over capacity, seat belts and telephones.
It should be noted that for March 1, 2022, there were 7 traffic accidents throughout Cambodia, in which 6 people were killed and 7 people were injured (4 people were seriously injured). During the past 60 days, there have been 606 traffic accidents, resulting in 344 deaths, 809 injuries (530 serious injuries). Banteay Meanchey Province
(Banteay Meanchey): On the morning of March 1, 2022, Senior Minister Ly Thuch, First Deputy Chairman of the Mine Authority, led a delegation from the Mine Clearance Project to inspect the land use clearance and meet with the beneficiaries. Banteay Meanchey Province.
Mr. Boeng Sruoch, Member of Svay Chek Commune Council, said that this clearing site is the land of the former hot battlefield, rich in landmines, but due to the need and lack of land to support the daily life of the family, the people who own the land decided to clear the land. This is both risky and has found a lot of mines and has to suspend the clearing force until there is a proper clearance under the demining project for this result.
He added that the demining site did not endanger the people as they were well aware of the situation and received more awareness about the dangers posed by mines and explosive remnants of war from our demining operators.
The beneficiaries are happy to meet directly with the donors to help secure their land, which will enable them to grow crops without fear and increase income for their families.
On that occasion, the Senior Minister urged all people to increase the use of cleared land and more and more people, not to leave the land vacant in order to improve the family situation and in accordance with the wishes. Donor generous wishes.
He advised residents to remain vigilant and not to enter areas that have not yet been cleared and suspected of being mined. France says Western sanctions will collapse Russia's economy
