Deputy Prime Minister Men Sam An: Women have made significant contributions to the cause of national unity and national security
(Phnom Penh): Ms. Kittisangkhab Dr. Men Sam An, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection, stated that women have now made significant contributions to the cause of national unification and protection of national security.
