Mr. Pablo Kang expressed his pleasure that Dr. Men Sam An allowed the meeting today. The ambassador said that Cambodia and Australia have jointly focused on gender issues and focused on the advancement of women in a number of areas, focusing on women's issues within the framework of security, peace and policy development. Prevent domestic violence as well.
"This year marks the 70th anniversary of diplomatic relations between Cambodia and Australia and is an important year in which Australia, as well as Cambodia and the world, are working together to prevent the spread of Kovid 19. (Omi City). "Australia has also provided assistance in the form of vaccines, medical equipment, as well as vaccine cabinets to Cambodia."
