Search for honors, have drugs, bring disaster! Nationwide drug crackdown for February 27: 14 cases cracked, 36 arrested
(Phnom Penh): The nationwide campaign against illegal drugs for February 27, 2022 showed that law enforcement forces cracked down on 14 cases, including 3 cases of use, 9 cases of trafficking, 2 cases of transport and storage. 36 suspects.
According to the report, from the results of law enforcement from February 1 to 27, 2022, law enforcement forces cracked down on 994 cases and detained 2,271 people (181 females).
